  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>If you can't do something well, you may as well not do it at all!</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Equipment Focus</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Choose an item slot that accepts equipment runes for which you have already taken the Equipment Focus feat. Add +1 to the Difficulty Class for all saving throws against spells from the school of magic you select. This stacks with the bonus granted by the Equipment Focus feat.</p>\n<p><strong>Special:</strong> You can gain Greater Equipment Focus multiple times. Each time, select a new item slot.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/runesmithing-feats#toc1\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
